    "pass_semantics": "All eight Cells must be structurally healthy with unique result.run_id values and no infrastructure failure. Each arm must execute at least one Validator-accepted Local Tool Call. The FSM arm must apply a non-full Local admissible set and must bind at least one accepted Local Tool Call to a matching next-request Tool Result and target state. A forced Cloud handoff is measured but is not required to occur by chance in eight Cells."
